• Work closely with Hyperconnect's machine learning engineers and ML software engineers to conceptualize and implement the most effective AI solutions. Additionally, manage project timelines, resources, and budgets to ensure the delivery of high-quality AI solutions on time
• Manage project timelines, resources, and budgets to ensure timely delivery of high-quality AI-driven solutions.
